  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting the African Elephants from Extinction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A gift to this project will save an African Elephant from dying. Today poaching has increased tenfold, putting them at risk for the ivory trade along with the Rhino. Climate change is destroying habitats and tourist trade has really impacted their homes, they are fighting a loosing battle. On the current path our children&apos;s children will likely never see an elephant in the wild in Africa unless we step up and force change to help protect and save these amazing animals.</narrative>
  </description>
